{"step_index":856,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T18:27:50Z","thinking":"Exploring UI enhancements to evoke a futuristic mission control aesthetic. Consider custom scrollbars with glowing teal/cyan tracks against a dark backdrop. Investigate glassmorphic HUD elements, potentially incorporating subtle scanline animations or cyber gridlines. Explore using glowing stat pills with ambient background glows and neon borders for metric cards.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Upgrade CSS styles to premium cybernetic industrial UI theme","EndLine":256,"Instruction":"Enhance global CSS with cybernetic styling, custom scrollbars, and glow effects","ReplacementContent":"<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700;900&family=Rajdhani:wght@500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');\n\n    /* Global Canvas & Ambient Cyber Grid */\n    .stApp {\n        background-color: #030712;\n        background-image: \n            radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),\n            radial-gradient(at 100% 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),\n            radial-gradient(at 50% 100%, rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.06) 0px, transparent 50%),\n            linear-gradient(rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),\n            linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);\n        background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 32px 32px, 32px 32px;\n        font-family: 'Rajdhani', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n        color: #e2e8f0;\n    }\n\n    /* Custom Cyber Slim Scrollbars */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n        width: 6px;\n        height: 6px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n        background: #050711;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n        background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25);\n        border-radius: 3px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n        background: #00f0ff;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00f0ff;\n    }\n    \n    /* Typography */\n    h1, h2, h3 {\n        font-family: 'Orbitron', -apple-system, sans-serif !important;\n        font-weight: 700 !important;\n        letter-spacing: 0.8px !important;\n        color: #f8fafc !important;\n        text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18);\n    }\n    h4, h5, h6 {\n        font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif !important;\n        font-weight: 700 !important;\n        letter-spacing: 0.6px !important;\n        color: #e2e8f0 !important;\n    }\n\n    /* Sleek Frosted Container Cards */\n    [data-testid=\"stVerticalBlockBorderWrapper\"] {\n        background: rgba(11, 17, 33, 0.72) !important;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.16) !important;\n        border-radius: 12px !important;\n        backdrop-filter: blur(20px) !important;\n        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) !important;\n        box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15) !important;\n        transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n    }\n    [data-testid=\"stVerticalBlockBorderWrapper\"]:hover {\n        border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35) !important;\n        box-shadow: 0 12px 40px 0 rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12), inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3) !important;\n    }\n\n    /* Live Telemetry Pulse Dot */\n    .pulse-dot {\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 8px;\n        height: 8px;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        background-color: #00f0ff;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00f0ff;\n        animation: pulse_glow 2s infinite ease-in-out;\n        margin-right: 6px;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .pulse-dot.green {\n        background-color: #05df9d;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #05df9d;\n    }\n    .pulse-dot.red {\n        background-color: #ff3366;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff3366;\n    }\n    .pulse-dot.orange {\n        background-color: #ffaa00;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ffaa00;\n    }\n    @keyframes pulse_glow {\n        0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; box-shadow: 0 0 4px currentColor; }\n        50% { transform: scale(1.25); opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0 0 14px currentColor; }\n        100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; box-shadow: 0 0 4px currentColor; }\n    }\n\n    /* HUD Banner */\n    .hud-banner {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        gap: 16px;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04) 100%);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.22);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        padding: 8px 16px;\n        margin: 10px 0;\n        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        color: #94a3b8;\n        letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n    }\n    .hud-banner .status-val {\n        color: #00f0ff;\n        font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    /* High-Tech Industrial Badges */\n    .badge {\n        display: inline-block;\n        padding: 3px 10px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        border: 1px solid transparent;\n    }\n    .badge-DEFECT    { background: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.15); color: #ff3366; border-color: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.2); }\n    .badge-PASS      { background: rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.15); color: #05df9d; border-color: rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.2); }\n    .badge-UNCERTAIN { background: rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.15); color: #ffaa00; border-color: rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.2); }\n    .badge-NOVEL     { background: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.15); color: #bf5af2; border-color: rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(191, 90, 242, 0.2); }\n    .badge-CRITICAL  { background: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.15); color: #ff3366; border-color: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.2); }\n    .badge-WARNING   { background: rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.15); color: #ffaa00; border-color: rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.2); }\n    .badge-OPTIMAL   { background: rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.15); color: #05df9d; border-color: rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(5, 223, 157, 0.2); }\n    .badge-HIGH      { background: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.15); color: #ff3366; border-color: rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.4); }\n    .badge-MEDIUM    { background: rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.15); color: #ffaa00; border-color: rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.4); }\n    .badge-LOW       { background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.15); color: #94a3b8; border-color: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.4); }\n\n    /* Evidence Box */\n    .evidence-box {\n        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        padding: 14px 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        border-left: 4px solid #00f0ff;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    }\n    .evidence-box.HIGH     { border-left-color: #ff3366; }\n    .evidence-box.CRITICAL { border-left-color: #ff3366; }\n    .evidence-box.MEDIUM   { border-left-color: #ffaa00; }\n    .evidence-box.WARNING  { border-left-color: #ffaa00; }\n    .evidence-box.LOW      { border-left-color: #64748b; }\n    .evidence-box.OPTIMAL  { border-left-color: #05df9d; }\n\n    /* Metric Pane */\n    .metric-pane {\n        background: rgba(13, 20, 38, 0.7);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        padding: 12px 14px;\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n    }\n\n    /* Tabs Styling */\n    .stTabs [data-baseweb=\"tab-list\"] {\n        gap: 8px;\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\n        background: rgba(11, 17, 33, 0.75);\n        padding: 6px 8px;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.16);\n    }\n    .stTabs [data-baseweb=\"tab\"] {\n        font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: 0.6px;\n        padding: 8px 20px;\n        background-color: transparent;\n        border: 1px solid transparent;\n        border-radius: 6px;\n        color: #94a3b8;\n        transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n    }\n    .stTabs [data-baseweb=\"tab\"]:hover {\n        color: #00f0ff;\n        background-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);\n    }\n    .stTabs [aria-selected=\"true\"] {\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18) 100%) !important;\n        color: #00f0ff !important;\n        border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.45) !important;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);\n    }\n\n    /* Metrics Values */\n    [data-testid=\"stMetricValue\"] {\n        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace !important;\n        font-weight: 700 !important;\n        color: #f8fafc !important;\n    }\n    [data-testid=\"stMetricLabel\"] {\n        font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif !important;\n        font-size: 12px !important;\n        font-weight: 600 !important;\n        letter-spacing: 0.6px !important;\n        text-transform: uppercase !important;\n        color: #94a3b8 !important;\n    }\n\n    /* Buttons */\n    .stButton>button {\n        font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif !important;\n        font-weight: 700 !important;\n        letter-spacing: 0.8px !important;\n        text-transform: uppercase !important;\n        border-radius: 6px !important;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3) !important;\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%) !important;\n        color: #f8fafc !important;\n        transition: all 0.2s ease !important;\n    }\n    .stButton>button:hover {\n        border-color: #00f0ff !important;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35) !important;\n        transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n    .stButton>button[kind=\"primary\"] {\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0077b6 0%, #00b4d8 100%) !important;\n        border-color: #00f0ff !important;\n        color: #ffffff !important;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3) !important;\n    }\n    .stButton>button[kind=\"primary\"]:hover {\n        box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6) !important;\n    }\n\n    /* Sliders */\n    .stSlider [data-baseweb=\"slider\"] {\n        margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n</style>","StartLine":44,"TargetContent":"<style>\n    @import url